+- `just test -p codex-app-server --test all injected_project_config --locked`
+- `just test -p codex-config --lib -E 'test(loader::)' --locked`
+- `just test -p codex-app-server --test all -E 'test(injected_local_runtime::) | test(suite::v2::config_rpc::)' --locked`
+
+Evidence: `C:/Dev/foldgpt-engine-project-config-tests.log`,
+`C:/Dev/foldgpt-engine-project-loader-regression.log` and
+`C:/Dev/foldgpt-engine-project-api-regression.log`. Tests run as the same
